  "ruleText": "Fam 103.03 Chairperson. The board elects a chairperson every 2 years by a majority vote.\n\nSource. #5609, eff 4-6-93, EXPIRED: 4-6-99\n\nNew. #7716, INTERIM, eff 6-22-02, EXPIRED: 12-19-02\n\nNew. #7916, eff 7-11-03; ss by #9667, eff 4-2-10",
